<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#999;padding:4px 14px 10px;font-style:italic;">Source: Statistics Canada, Consumer Price Index, April 2026 release (May 19, 2026). Bank of Canada core inflation measures. &nbsp;|&nbsp; hdq.ca</div>
