<p>Has the conflict changed how you are thinking about any major financial decisions you were planning for the second half of 2026?</p>
<p>Are you aware of how the Trans Mountain Pipeline expansion has changed the relationship between Canadian energy producers and the Hormuz disruption specifically?</p>
</div>
